.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH oct-pin-reset-user 1  "oct-pin-reset-user " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
oct\-pin\-reset\-user \- Reset User PIN with Admin PIN
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBoct pin reset\-user\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR] [\fB\-p\fR|\fB\-\-user\-pin\-new\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Reset User PIN with Admin PIN
.PP
Set a new User PIN by providing the Admin PIN. This can also be used if the User PIN has been blocked.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-admin\-pin\fR \fI<Admin PIN file>\fR
Optionally, get Admin PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-p\fR, \fB\-\-user\-pin\-new\fR \fI<User PIN file new>\fR
Optionally, get new User PIN from a file
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
